<title>GERMANY: Thyssen plans to sell unit to IWKA unit.</title>
<headline>Thyssen plans to sell unit to IWKA unit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German steel maker Thyssen AG said on Friday that it plans to sell its Henschel Wehrtechnik unit to KUKA Wehrtechnik, a unit of IWKA AG.</p>
<p>Thyssen said that KUKA will buy the unit on January 1, 1997 but that Henschel Wehrtechnik will first be turned into a separate legal entity, Henschel Wehrtechnik GmbH, on October 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Thyssen said the sale, still subject to cartel office approval, is part of an overall business reorganisation.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
